 "nl": [
  "printers must accept HTTP (TCP 80) and PostgreSQL (TCP 5432) and RTSP (TCP 554) from edge-cache.",
  "dns-servers is isolated: it may only reach printers on syslog (UDP 514); vpn-users on HTTPS (TCP 443), and nothing else.",
  "Allow vpn-users to connect to edge-cache using PostgreSQL (TCP 5432).",
  "Allow printers to connect to dev-lab using DNS over UDP 53 and IMAP (TCP 143) and HTTPS (TCP 443).",
  "Permit any UDP port from printers to dns-servers but deny TFTP (UDP 69).",
  "Hosts in partners may reach edge-cache over RTSP (TCP 554) and MySQL (TCP 3306) and SNMP (UDP 161).",
  "Make HTTP (TCP 80) and DNS over UDP 53 on dns-servers reachable from all internal zones.",
  "printers must accept DNS over UDP 53 and IMAP (TCP 143) from partners.",
  "Allow dns-servers to connect to partners using SMB (TCP 445) and RTSP (TCP 554) and RDP (TCP 3389).",
  "dev-lab must accept SNMP (UDP 161) and syslog (UDP 514) from vpn-users.",
  "Block PostgreSQL (TCP 5432), MySQL (TCP 3306), RDP (TCP 3389) from dev-lab to edge-cache; the rest of TCP ports 1024-65535 between them is allowed.",
  "No packet from partners may enter dev-lab, even for services open to everyone.",
  "Allow edge-cache to connect to dns-servers using RTSP (TCP 554).",
  "edge-cache must accept MySQL (TCP 3306) from dns-servers.",
  "Deny all traffic from printers to partners (this overrides any public service)."
 ],
